  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A standing wave with a first harmonic of frequency <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"f_{1}\"></span> is formed on a string fixed at both ends.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>The frequency of the third harmonic is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"f_{3}\"></span>.</p>\n<p>What is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{f_{1}}{f_{3}}\"></span>?</p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\">3</li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{3}{2}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{2}{3}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{3}\"></span></li></ol>"
